n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"NPC\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">NPC</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Lumi Laurence</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.51.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">March 1st, 2024</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\nThe <b>River Shop</b> is a store located in the <a href=\"/wiki/River_Caves\" title=\"River Caves\">River Caves</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>Rather than dealing directly in cash, the shopkeeper <a href=\"/wiki/Lumi_Laurence\" title=\"Lumi Laurence\">Lumi Laurence</a> deals in Lumite Credits. This currency is earned by bringing <b>raw</b> pieces of <a href=\"/wiki/Lumite\" title=\"Lumite\">Lumite</a> to the exchange station and talking to <a href=\"/wiki/Lumi_Laurence\" title=\"Lumi Laurence\">Lumi</a>, who will buy each piece of Lumite in exchange for 1 Lumite Credit.\n</p><p>Lumi sells items that are mostly related to improving the player's ability to harvest resources from the River Caves.\n</p><p>The River Shop is found by going in the River Cave and following the middle path upstream relative to the entrance from the main waterfall. Following the route will lead to a visible hidden entrance behind the waterfall with fluorescent clusters of Lumite crystals.\n</p><p>At the top of the desert cave, also reachable from the River Cave, in the water, there's a side cave that'll also lead directly into the River Shop.\n</p>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"ae5b3b6150bca1bc44a1b909c7c56fd2\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:106px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"RiverShopTopEntrance1-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:104px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:RiverShopTopEntrance1.png\" title=\"RiverShopTopEntrance1.png (3.92 MB)\" style=\"height:104px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d8/RiverShopTopEntrance1.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240522235022\" title=\"RiverShopTopEntrance1.png (3.92 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"104\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"RiverShopTopEntrance1.png\" data-image-key=\"RiverShopTopEntrance1.png\" data-relevant=\"1\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"RiverShopTopEntrance1.png (3.92 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"104\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"RiverShopTopEntrance1.png\" data-image-key=\"RiverShopTopEntrance1.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d8/RiverShopTopEntrance1.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240522235022\" /></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:106px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"RiverShopTopEntrance2-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:104px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"im